{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011spijzrVVkwDWkRZTiHhXf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立——''emergent phase-strategy interaction'' 作为 compound\n2\t  sparsity 的新发现轴被认可。 LLaMA n=250 将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级至 confirmed（imp_vs_rand\n3\t  在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著， 证明 strategy×phase 交互并非 Qwen2 架构特有）。GPQA 跨 benchmark\n4\t  复现 strategy specificity， 消除 \"task-specific artifact\" 疑虑（imp/rand ratio 5-10× 在 graduate-level\n5\t  reasoning 上成立）。 四层泛化（cross-model/architecture/benchmark/scale）+ GPQA 第五层形成封闭证据链。\n6\t  50篇引用 + Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES 三重区分论证被接受为充分 novelty。 Correlational diagnostic\n7\t  framing + p=s 显式声明消除 RC 质疑。Paper 无需调整 claims 强度。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n12\t  plan_id: c8_llama_n250\n13\t  description: 'LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (imp/rand\n14\t    × s015/s020/s025/s030). 升级 C8 从 partially_confirmed 到 confirmed。关键：imp_vs_rand\n15\t    d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著，证明 strategy×phase 交互跨架构泛化。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    n_problems: 250\n20\t    n_valid: 244\n21\t    n_bootstrap: 10000\n22\t    bonferroni_k: 4\n23\t    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n24\t      s015: 0.24\n25\t      s020: 0.31\n26\t      s025: 0.38\n27\t      s030: 0.43\n28\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n29\t      s015:\n30\t      - 0.11\n31\t      - 0.37\n32\t      s020:\n33\t      - 0.18\n34\t      - 0.44\n35\t      s025:\n36\t      - 0.25\n37\t      - 0.51\n38\t      s030:\n39\t      - 0.3\n40\t      - 0.56\n41\t    imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p:\n42\t      s015: 0.00032\n43\t      s020: 8.9e-06\n44\t      s025: 1.4e-08\n45\t      s030: 2.1e-10\n46\t    imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n47\t      s015: 0.00128\n48\t      s020: 3.56e-05\n49\t      s025: 5.6e-08\n50\t      s030: 8.4e-10\n51\t    significant_bonferroni:\n52\t      s015: true\n53\t      s020: true\n54\t      s025: true\n55\t      s030: true\n56\t    bonferroni_significant_count: 4\n57\t    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n58\t    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n59\t      s015: 1.02\n60\t      s020: 1.09\n61\t      s025: 1.12\n62\t      s030: 1.05\n63\t    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large (>1.0, CI excludes zero)\n64\t    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n65\t      s015: 0.36\n66\t      s020: 0.38\n67\t      s025: 0.42\n68\t      s030: 0.41\n69\t    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small (0.36-0.42, CI excludes zero —\n70\t      architecture-specific)\n71\t    median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n72\t      s015: 0.018\n73\t      s020: 0.052\n74\t      s025: 0.285\n75\t      s030: 0.612\n76\t    median_diff_ci:\n77\t      s015:\n78\t      - 0.004\n79\t      - 0.035\n80\t      s020:\n81\t      - 0.012\n82\t      - 0.098\n83\t      s025:\n84\t      - 0.141\n85\t      - 0.442\n86\t      s030:\n87\t      - 0.318\n88\t      - 0.935\n89\t    imp_phase_gradient_median_diff:\n90\t      s015: 0.085\n91\t      s020: 0.198\n92\t      s025: 0.376\n93\t      s030: 0.748\n94\t    rand_phase_gradient_median_diff:\n95\t      s015: 0.041\n96\t      s020: 0.089\n97\t      s025: 0.143\n98\t      s030: 0.221\n99\t    imp_rand_gradient_ratio:\n100\t      s015: 2.1\n101\t      s020: 2.2\n102\t      s025: 2.6\n103\t      s030: 3.4\n104\t  result_rationale: 'n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19→0.34（单调递增），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著（p=0.029）。\n105\t    n=50 的 SE≈0.14 导致估计值噪声大；c8_llama_gpu0_s025 (n=250, importance-only) 已确认 importance\n106\t    phase gradient d_z=1.12 (p=4.3e-39)，表明 importance 信号极强。 n=250 时 SE≈0.063，对 true\n107\t    d_z≥0.35 的效应有 >95% power 检测。 n=50 时 d_z 被低估（样本噪声向零收缩），n=250 精确估计将揭示 true d_z 在\n108\t    0.38-0.43 区间（s025/s030）。 LLaMA 上 random 也有 phase gradient 是架构特性（MHA vs GQA），但\n109\t    importance 仍然系统性更大 （ratio 2-3×），足以支持 strategy×phase 交互在 LLaMA 架构上成立。 关键区别：Qwen2/DeepSeek\n110\t    的 imp_rand_ratio 为 15-38×，LLaMA 为 2-3×——交互存在但弱于 GQA 架构，因为 LLaMA MHA 的 28 heads\n111\t    使 random pruning 本身就有更大方差（非均匀 head importance）。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t  tables:\n115\t  - title: 'Table: Cross-architecture imp_vs_rand d_z comparison (n=250)'\n116\t    content: '| Sparsity | Qwen2 (n=500) | DeepSeek (n=500) | LLaMA (n=250) |\n117\t\n118\t      |----------|---------------|------------------|---------------|\n119\t\n120\t      | s015     | 0.44*         | 0.44*            | 0.24*         |\n121\t\n122\t      | s020     | 0.63*         | 0.52*            | 0.31*         |\n123\t\n124\t      | s025     | 0.87*         | 0.68*            | 0.38*         |\n125\t\n126\t      | s030     | 0.92*         | 0.80*            | 0.43*         |\n127\t\n128\t      * = Bonferroni p<0.05\n129\t\n130\t      '\n131\t  figures_description:\n132\t  - 'Fig: imp_vs_rand d_z across 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels, with 95% CI\n133\t    bands. LLaMA shows consistent positive slope but flatter than Qwen2/DeepSeek.'\n134\t  analysis: 'C8 升级为 confirmed。关键升级依据：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni\n135\t    显著， 驳斥 ''strategy×phase 交互是 Qwen2 架构 artifact'' 假说；(2) d_z 单调递增确认 dose-response；\n136\t    (3) importance phase gradient 全 4 水平 d_z>1.0 证明 phase modulation 跨架构泛化。 限定：LLaMA\n137\t    上 random 也有 non-trivial phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.42），strategy-dependence 幅度弱于\n138\t    Qwen2（ratio 2-3× vs 15-38×）。论文用 \"strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal\n139\t    in direction but architecture-dependent in magnitude\" 叙述。\n140\t\n141\t    '\n142\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n143\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s015\n144\t  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 在 GPQA Diamond (n=50) 上的 importance masking\n145\t    phase gradient, sparsity=0.15。验证 compound severity phase modulation 在 graduate-level\n146\t    reasoning 上成立。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t  expected_results:\n150\t    n_problems: 50\n151\t    benchmark: GPQA Diamond\n152\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n153\t    sparsity: 0.15\n154\t    strategy: importance\n155\t    interaction_index:\n156\t      high:\n157\t        median: 0.012\n158\t        mean: 0.085\n159\t        ci:\n160\t        - 0.031\n161\t        - 0.152\n162\t      mid:\n163\t        median: 0.145\n164\t        mean: 0.412\n165\t        ci:\n166\t        - 0.218\n167\t        - 0.654\n168\t      low:\n169\t        median: 0.528\n170\t        mean: 1.876\n171\t        ci:\n172\t        - 1.124\n173\t        - 2.812\n174\t    median_difference: 0.516\n175\t    median_difference_ci:\n176\t    - 0.298\n177\t    - 0.782\n178\t    wilcoxon_p: 4.0e-05\n179\t    cohens_dz: 0.62\n180\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n181\t    phase_stats:\n182\t      high:\n183\t        n_tokens: 18500\n184\t        n_segments: 320\n185\t      mid:\n186\t        n_tokens: 22400\n187\t        n_segments: 245\n188\t      low:\n189\t        n_tokens: 35200\n190\t        n_segments: 410\n191\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond 问题需要更长推理链（graduate-level physics/chemistry/biology），thinking\n192\t    phase 占比更高。DeepSeek 在 MATH-500 s015 median_diff=0.39，GPQA 上因推理链更长（~50% more tokens），\n193\t    low-sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，predicted median_diff 略高（0.52）。 效应量\n194\t    d_z=0.62 介于 MATH-500 s015 (d_z=0.61) 和 s020 (d_z=0.73) 之间，合理—— GPQA 更难问题有更多 deep\n195\t    thinking tokens 聚集在 low-sparsity phase，放大了 phase gradient。\n196\t\n197\t    '\n198\t  tables: []\n199\t  figures_description: []\n200\t  analysis: ''\n201\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n202\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s020\n203\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.20. 验证 dose-response 在 GPQA 上单调递增。\n204\t\n205\t    '\n206\t  expected_results:\n207\t    n_problems: 50\n208\t    sparsity: 0.2\n209\t    strategy: importance\n210\t    interaction_index:\n211\t      high:\n212\t        median: 0.028\n213\t        mean: 0.195\n214\t        ci:\n215\t        - 0.082\n216\t        - 0.338\n217\t      mid:\n218\t        median: 0.418\n219\t        mean: 1.352\n220\t        ci:\n221\t        - 0.784\n222\t        - 2.106\n223\t      low:\n224\t        median: 1.825\n225\t        mean: 6.284\n226\t        ci:\n227\t        - 4.102\n228\t        - 9.128\n229\t    median_difference: 1.797\n230\t    median_difference_ci:\n231\t    - 1.062\n232\t    - 2.684\n233\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-07\n234\t    cohens_dz: 0.84\n235\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n236\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s020 median_diff=1.48, GPQA predicted 1.80 (+22%).\n237\t    增幅来源： GPQA 推理链更长，low-phase 段落含更多 multi-step deduction，importance scores 的 discrimination\n238\t    collapse 在长链中累积更严重。d_z=0.84 与 MATH-500 s020 (d_z=0.73)  相比偏高，因为 GPQA 的 per-problem\n239\t    方差更低（问题难度更均匀，都是 graduate-level）。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t  tables: []\n243\t  figures_description: []\n244\t  analysis: ''\n245\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n246\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s025\n247\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.25. 验证 strategy specificity（与\n248\t    random 对比基线）。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t  expected_results:\n252\t    n_problems: 50\n253\t    sparsity: 0.25\n254\t    strategy: importance\n255\t    interaction_index:\n256\t      high:\n257\t        median: 0.065\n258\t        mean: 0.448\n259\t        ci:\n260\t        - 0.215\n261\t        - 0.742\n262\t      mid:\n263\t        median: 1.562\n264\t        mean: 5.824\n265\t        ci:\n266\t        - 3.412\n267\t        - 8.956\n268\t      low:\n269\t        median: 5.842\n270\t        mean: 22.156\n271\t        ci:\n272\t        - 15.428\n273\t        - 30.612\n274\t    median_difference: 5.777\n275\t    median_difference_ci:\n276\t    - 3.824\n277\t    - 8.214\n278\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.4e-09\n279\t    cohens_dz: 1.05\n280\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n281\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s025 median_diff=3.99, GPQA predicted 5.78 (+45%).\n282\t    放大效应增大是因为 s025 时 discrimination collapse 进入非线性区域——pruning 196/784 heads (25%)\n283\t    后 importance score Gini 系数下降约 6%，在更长的 GPQA 推理链中该 collapse 的 token-level 影响被 multiplicatively\n284\t    放大。Cohen''s d_z 突破 1.0 标志着 strong effect size。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t  tables: []\n288\t  figures_description: []\n289\t  analysis: ''\n290\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n291\t  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s030\n292\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.30. Dose-response 最高点，用于计算 imp/rand\n293\t    ratio。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t  expected_results:\n297\t    n_problems: 50\n298\t    sparsity: 0.3\n299\t    strategy: importance\n300\t    interaction_index:\n301\t      high:\n302\t        median: 0.112\n303\t        mean: 0.824\n304\t        ci:\n305\t        - 0.412\n306\t        - 1.356\n307\t      mid:\n308\t        median: 3.245\n309\t        mean: 12.562\n310\t        ci:\n311\t        - 7.842\n312\t        - 18.924\n313\t      low:\n314\t        median: 12.856\n315\t        mean: 52.418\n316\t        ci:\n317\t        - 36.214\n318\t        - 72.846\n319\t    median_difference: 12.744\n320\t    median_difference_ci:\n321\t    - 8.612\n322\t    - 18.256\n323\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.8e-11\n324\t    cohens_dz: 1.22\n325\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n326\t    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n327\t    dose_response_sequence:\n328\t    - 0.516\n329\t    - 1.797\n330\t    - 5.777\n331\t    - 12.744\n332\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s030 median_diff=8.48, GPQA predicted 12.74 (+50%).\n333\t    Severity amplification 在最高 sparsity 处最大——30% head pruning 使 importance scores\n334\t    几乎完全失去判别力 (Gini delta ≈ -0.08)，KV eviction 本质退化为 biased pseudo-random。GPQA 的 longer\n335\t    reasoning chains (平均 ~1200 tokens thinking vs MATH-500 ~550 tokens) 使这一退化 在更多\n336\t    segments 上累积，产生更大的 phase gradient。Dose-response 完美单调 (0.52→1.80→5.78→12.74，growth\n337\t    factors 3.5×→3.2×→2.2× 递减 = sub-exponential confirmed)。\n338\t\n339\t    '\n340\t  tables: []\n341\t  figures_description: []\n342\t  analysis: ''\n343\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n344\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_s025\n345\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25. 基线对照——验证 strategy specificity。\n346\t\n347\t    '\n348\t  expected_results:\n349\t    n_problems: 50\n350\t    sparsity: 0.25\n351\t    strategy: random\n352\t    interaction_index:\n353\t      high:\n354\t        median: 0.682\n355\t        mean: 2.145\n356\t        ci:\n357\t        - 0.856\n358\t        - 3.812\n359\t      mid:\n360\t        median: 0.845\n361\t        mean: 1.924\n362\t        ci:\n363\t        - 0.512\n364\t        - 3.648\n365\t      low:\n366\t        median: 1.124\n367\t        mean: 2.856\n368\t        ci:\n369\t        - 1.245\n370\t        - 4.812\n371\t    median_difference: 0.442\n372\t    median_difference_ci:\n373\t    - -0.125\n374\t    - 1.048\n375\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.062\n376\t    cohens_dz: 0.18\n377\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n378\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 13.1\n379\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 n=500 DS random s025 median_diff=0.257 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA\n380\t    n=50 功效较低， random 在 s025 上 borderline NS (p=0.062)。Random 有微弱 phase gradient 但远小于\n381\t    importance (median_diff 0.44 vs 5.78 = 13.1× ratio)。这与 MATH-500 的 15.5-38.6× ratio\n382\t    一致（GPQA 稍低因 n=50 noise 更大）。关键：strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 replicates，importance/random\n383\t    比值 >5× 证明 phase-dependent compound severity 不是 任何 masking 都会产生的 artifact，而是 importance-specific\n384\t    的。\n385\t\n386\t    '\n387\t  tables: []\n388\t  figures_description: []\n389\t  analysis: ''\n390\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n391\t  plan_id: gpqa_random_s030\n392\t  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30. 最高 sparsity 对照，计算 imp/rand\n393\t    ratio。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  expected_results:\n397\t    n_problems: 50\n398\t    sparsity: 0.3\n399\t    strategy: random\n400\t    interaction_index:\n401\t      high:\n402\t        median: 1.856\n403\t        mean: 4.524\n404\t        ci:\n405\t        - 2.412\n406\t        - 7.124\n407\t      mid:\n408\t        median: 2.124\n409\t        mean: 5.212\n410\t        ci:\n411\t        - 2.856\n412\t        - 8.148\n413\t      low:\n414\t        median: 2.812\n415\t        mean: 6.148\n416\t        ci:\n417\t        - 3.524\n418\t        - 9.412\n419\t    median_difference: 0.956\n420\t    median_difference_ci:\n421\t    - 0.124\n422\t    - 1.842\n423\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.018\n424\t    cohens_dz: 0.28\n425\t    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n426\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 13.3\n427\t  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 n=500 DS random s030 median_diff=0.51 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA\n428\t    s030 random  median_diff=0.96 略高，因 GPQA 更长推理链使 random masking 的 phase gradient\n429\t    也有 微弱放大。但 importance/random ratio=13.3× (12.74/0.96) 维持在 [5, 15] 目标区间内。 Random\n430\t    在 s030 达到统计显著(p=0.018) 与 MATH-500 模式一致——存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025 以上 random\n431\t    也触发，但 magnitude 远小于 importance。GPQA 复现了 MATH-500  和 GSM8K 的双层结构：(1) phase gradient\n432\t    存在性跨 strategy 普遍; (2) magnitude  modulation 是 importance-specific（5-15× amplification）。\n433\t\n434\t    '\n435\t  tables: []\n436\t  figures_description: []\n437\t  analysis: ''\n438\t- name: gpqa_aggregate_cross_benchmark\n439\t  plan_id: gpqa_cross_benchmark_synthesis\n440\t  description: 'GPQA 与 MATH-500/GSM8K 三 benchmark 对比综合分析。验证 phase gradient 跨 benchmark  robustness\n441\t    和 strategy specificity task-modulation。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t  expected_results:\n445\t    gpqa_importance_gradient_monotonic: true\n446\t    gpqa_importance_gradient:\n447\t    - 0.516\n448\t    - 1.797\n449\t    - 5.777\n450\t    - 12.744\n451\t    math500_importance_gradient:\n452\t    - 0.393\n453\t    - 1.215\n454\t    - 3.986\n455\t    - 8.481\n456\t    gsm8k_importance_gradient:\n457\t    - 0.241\n458\t    - 0.74\n459\t    - 1.992\n460\t    - 4.682\n461\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio:\n462\t      s025: 13.1\n463\t      s030: 13.3\n464\t    math500_imp_rand_ratio:\n465\t      s025: 15.5\n466\t      s030: 16.6\n467\t    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio:\n468\t      s025: 3.8\n469\t      s030: 2.8\n470\t    difficulty_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\n471\t    gradient_magnitude_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\n472\t    strategy_specificity_ordering: MATH-500 ≈ GPQA >> GSM8K\n473\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_rho: 1.0\n474\t  result_rationale: '三 benchmark 形成 difficulty gradient：GSM8K (小学数学, short chains)\n475\t    < MATH-500  (竞赛数学, medium chains) < GPQA (graduate-level, long chains)。Phase gradient\n476\t    magnitude 与 benchmark difficulty 正相关——更难的问题需要更长 thinking，low-sparsity phase  accumulates\n477\t    更多 compound interaction。Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 在 GPQA  和 MATH-500\n478\t    上强(13-16×) 而 GSM8K 弱(2.3-3.8×)，因为 GSM8K 推理链短且步骤简单， importance scores 的 discrimination\n479\t    collapse 在短链上影响较小。这证明 strategy specificity 不是 task-specific artifact 而是 reasoning\n480\t    depth-dependent：deeper reasoning →  stronger strategy specificity。GPQA 作为最难 benchmark\n481\t    上 ratio≥5× 确认了这一点。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t  tables: []\n485\t  figures_description: []\n486\t  analysis: ''\n487\t- name: reviewer_outcome_simulation\n488\t  plan_id: paper_submission_outcome\n489\t  description: '模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 评分和 acceptance outcome，基于 best tier 的完整证据链。\n490\t\n491\t    '\n492\t  expected_results:\n493\t    reviewer_1:\n494\t      overall_score: 4.0\n495\t      soundness: 4\n496\t      novelty: 3.5\n497\t      significance: 3.5\n498\t      clarity: 4.0\n499\t      main_concern: Strategy specificity weakens on GSM8K (2-4×) — task-dependence\n500\t        mechanism unclear\n501\t      novelty_challenge: false\n502\t      accepts_framing: true\n503\t    reviewer_2:\n504\t      overall_score: 4.2\n505\t      soundness: 4.5\n506\t      novelty: 4.0\n507\t      significance: 3.5\n508\t      clarity: 4.0\n509\t      main_concern: 7B scale only — unclear if effect persists at 70B+\n510\t      novelty_challenge: false\n511\t      accepts_framing: true\n512\t    reviewer_3:\n513\t      overall_score: 3.8\n514\t      soundness: 4.0\n515\t      novelty: 3.0\n516\t      significance: 3.5\n517\t      clarity: 3.5\n518\t      main_concern: Entropy mechanism model-dependent weakens theoretical contribution\n519\t      novelty_challenge: true\n520\t      challenge_resolved: true\n521\t      resolution: 50 citations differentiation + empirical finding paper positioning\n522\t        accepted\n523\t    average_reviewer_score: 4.0\n524\t    novelty_challenged_by_reviewers: 1\n525\t    meta_reviewer_assessment: Solid empirical contribution with thorough cross-validation.\n526\t      Minor concerns about scale generalization and mechanism incompleteness. Recommend\n527\t      accept.\n528\t    accept_probability: 0.65\n529\t    decision: accept (poster)\n530\t  result_rationale: 'Best tier 假设所有结构性修复被接受。具体映射： (1) 50篇引用 + ThinKV/HIES/Physics\n531\t    of KV Cache 三重区分 → R3 novelty challenge 被 化解，从 \"this is already known\" 降级为 \"minor\n532\t    concern about positioning\"; (2) Correlational diagnostic framing → 消除 \"importance\n533\t    is broken\" 误读，soundness 分数 维持 4.0+（不再被扣 \"misleading claim\" 分）; (3) p=s 显式声明 +\n534\t    完整 config → reproducibility concern 消失; (4) Entropy model-dependence → 被接受为 interesting\n535\t    nuance (\"cross-model consistency  in Gini collapse is the main story, entropy\n536\t    is secondary\"); (5) LLaMA n=250 confirmed → \"three models, two architectures\"\n537\t    回应 generalizability; (6) GPQA replication → \"three benchmarks spanning elementary\n538\t    to graduate\" 加强说服力。 均分 4.0 在 EMNLP 属于 borderline accept → accept 区间。1/3 reviewer\n539\t    challenge novelty 但通过 rebuttal 解决 → 不影响最终决定。Accept probability 0.65 = 中等偏上信心。\n540\t\n541\t    '\n542\t  tables: []\n543\t  figures_description: []\n544\t  analysis: ''\n545\t- name: novelty_structural_fix_outcome\n546\t  plan_id: novelty_defense\n547\t  description: '50篇引用 + 三篇核心区分论文 (Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES) 的 novelty 论证效果评估。\n548\t\n549\t    '\n550\t  expected_results:\n551\t    total_citations: 52\n552\t    key_differentiation_papers:\n553\t    - paper: Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426)\n554\t      differentiation: single-axis phase transition vs our compound×phase×strategy\n555\t      reviewer_acceptance: true\n556\t    - paper: ThinKV (2510.01290)\n557\t      differentiation: single-axis phase-aware eviction vs our compound interaction\n558\t        analysis\n559\t      reviewer_acceptance: true\n560\t    - paper: HIES (2510.13832)\n561\t      differentiation: single-axis score collapse → independent supporting evidence\n562\t        for our mechanism\n563\t      reviewer_acceptance: true\n564\t    related_work_gap_analysis_accepted: true\n565\t    novelty_score_range:\n566\t    - 3.0\n567\t    - 4.0\n568\t    novelty_mean: 3.5\n569\t  result_rationale: 'Prior work 分三类且无重叠：(a) compound compression methods (SparK, SLiM)\n570\t    不分析 phase; (b) single-axis phase-aware (ThinKV, R-KV) 不涉及 compound; (c) phase\n571\t    transition  analysis (Physics of KV Cache) 是 compression-rate phase 不是 reasoning\n572\t    phase。 我们是唯一同时分析 compound × reasoning-phase × strategy 三维交互的。HIES 的  importance\n573\t    score collapse 发现还为 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证。 52 篇引用覆盖了 2024-2026 所有相关工作，reviewer\n574\t    很难再指出 \"missed important prior work\"。 Novelty 均分 3.5 = \"some novelty\" → 对 empirical\n575\t    finding paper 已足够。\n576\t\n577\t    '\n578\t  tables: []\n579\t  figures_description: []\n580\t  analysis: ''\n581\t- name: reproducibility_fix_outcome\n582\t  plan_id: reproducibility_defense\n583\t  description: 'p=s 显式声明 + 完整实验配置描述解决 reproducibility concern 的预期效果。\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t  expected_results:\n587\t    config_disclosure:\n588\t      pruning_rate_declaration: p=s (pruning rate equals sparsity level)\n589\t      head_selection: lowest attention score heads removed\n590\t      kv_eviction: 'importance-based: lowest cumulative attention; random: uniform\n591\t        random'\n592\t      phase_segmentation: quantile-based on dense model sparsity profile\n593\t      bootstrap_params: B=10000, paired per-problem\n594\t      bonferroni_k: 4\n595\t      seed: 42\n596\t    reproducibility_concern_raised: 0\n597\t    appendix_config_table: true\n598\t    code_release_promised: true\n599\t  result_rationale: 'RC5 (reproducibility) 的根源是原稿未明确 p=s（pruning rate = sparsity parameter），\n600\t    reviewer 误以为存在额外 hidden hyperparameter。显式声明 \"we set head pruning rate = KV  eviction\n601\t    rate = s for symmetric compound sparsity\" + Appendix 完整 config table  (model,\n602\t    sparsity, n_heads_pruned, kv_budget, phase_boundaries, seeds) 使实验完全可复现。 Code release\n603\t    承诺（camera-ready 时开放）进一步消除疑虑。预期：0 reviewers raise  reproducibility concern（best\n604\t    tier assumption）。\n605\t\n606\t    '\n607\t  tables: []\n608\t  figures_description: []\n609\t  analysis: ''\n610\t- name: c8_status_upgrade\n611\t  plan_id: c8_claim_upgrade\n612\t  description: 'C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed 后的 claim table 更新和论文叙述调整。\n613\t\n614\t    '\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    old_status: partially_confirmed\n617\t    new_status: confirmed\n618\t    qualification_change:\n619\t      old: suggests / provides partial support\n620\t      new: confirms cross-architecture generalization with architecture-dependent\n621\t        magnitude\n622\t    paper_language_update:\n623\t      abstract: Phase-strategy interaction generalizes across three models and two\n624\t        architectures (Qwen2, LLaMA)\n625\t      conclusion: Cross-architecture replication (n=250) confirms strategy×phase interaction\n626\t        is architecture-universal\n627\t    remaining_qualification: magnitude of strategy×phase interaction is architecture-dependent\n628\t      (2-3× on LLaMA vs 15-38× on Qwen2/DeepSeek)\n629\t  result_rationale: 'n=50 时 LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.34 (s030) 仅 borderline significant，限制了\n630\t    claim 强度。 n=250 功效充分后，s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著 (d_z≥0.38)，确认 strategy×phase 交互\n631\t    在 LLaMA 架构上统计显著存在（非 sampling noise）。升级 C8 允许论文从 \"suggests\" 改为  \"confirms\"，但保留\n632\t    \"architecture-dependent magnitude\" 限定——这是诚实的科学陈述， 也预防 reviewer 质疑 \"why is LLaMA\n633\t    effect weaker\"（主动承认 = 显示 self-awareness）。\n634\t\n635\t    '\n636\t  tables: []\n637\t  figures_description: []\n638\t  analysis: ''\n639\t- name: gpqa_strategy_specificity_confirmation\n640\t  plan_id: gpqa_specificity\n641\t  description: 'GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio ≥ 5×) 确认后，驳斥 \"task-specific\n642\t    artifact\" 假说。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t  expected_results:\n646\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 13.1\n647\t    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 13.3\n648\t    math500_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 15.5\n649\t    math500_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 16.6\n650\t    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.8\n651\t    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.8\n652\t    pattern: ratio scales with reasoning depth, not task identity\n653\t    task_specificity_hypothesis_rejected: true\n654\t    mechanism_explanation: 'Strategy specificity 与 reasoning depth 正相关：GPQA (long\n655\t      chains) ≈ MATH-500 (medium)  >> GSM8K (short). 这排除了 \"specificity is an artifact\n656\t      of MATH-500 problem structure\"， 因为相同 pattern 在不同 domain (math vs science) 和\n657\t      difficulty 上复现。 低 ratio 在 GSM8K 上的原因是：短推理链中 importance scores 的 discrimination\n658\t      collapse 影响有限（fewer tokens accumulated in low-phase），random 和 importance 的 phase  gradient\n659\t      差异被压缩。\n660\t\n661\t      '\n662\t  result_rationale: GSM8K ratio 2.3-3.8× 曾引发 \"strategy specificity may be benchmark-specific\"\n663\t    担忧。 GPQA ratio 13× (与 MATH-500 15× comparable) 证明 specificity 是 reasoning depth\n664\t    的 函数而非 task artifact。三 benchmark 形成清晰 pattern：ratio ∝ avg_reasoning_length。 这转化了一个潜在\n665\t    weakness (GSM8K 低 ratio) 为 additional finding：strategy specificity 的 magnitude\n666\t    是 reasoning complexity-modulated，为 Discussion §6 提供了额外 insight。\n667\t  tables: []\n668\t  figures_description: []\n669\t  analysis: ''\n670\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16acc6c0-2bc8-4647-8b19-962cbe1441c4","uuid":"031a1b67-3880-4e7e-aa2e-9d5cce7dd15c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:16:22.823Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T164305/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立——''emergent phase-strategy interaction'' 作为 compound\n  sparsity 的新发现轴被认可。 LLaMA n=250 将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级至 confirmed（imp_vs_rand\n  在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著， 证明 strategy×phase 交互并非 Qwen2 架构特有）。GPQA 跨 benchmark\n  复现 strategy specificity， 消除 \"task-specific artifact\" 疑虑（imp/rand ratio 5-10× 在 graduate-level\n  reasoning 上成立）。 四层泛化（cross-model/architecture/benchmark/scale）+ GPQA 第五层形成封闭证据链。\n  50篇引用 + Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES 三重区分论证被接受为充分 novelty。 Correlational diagnostic\n  framing + p=s 显式声明消除 RC 质疑。Paper 无需调整 claims 强度。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: c8_llama_n250_fixed\n  plan_id: c8_llama_n250\n  description: 'LLaMA-8B (DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B) n=250, 8 conditions (imp/rand\n    × s015/s020/s025/s030). 升级 C8 从 partially_confirmed 到 confirmed。关键：imp_vs_rand\n    d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著，证明 strategy×phase 交互跨架构泛化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 250\n    n_valid: 244\n    n_bootstrap: 10000\n    bonferroni_k: 4\n    imp_vs_rand_dz:\n      s015: 0.24\n      s020: 0.31\n      s025: 0.38\n      s030: 0.43\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.37\n      s020:\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.44\n      s025:\n      - 0.25\n      - 0.51\n      s030:\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.56\n    imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p:\n      s015: 0.00032\n      s020: 8.9e-06\n      s025: 1.4e-08\n      s030: 2.1e-10\n    imp_vs_rand_wilcoxon_p_bonferroni:\n      s015: 0.00128\n      s020: 3.56e-05\n      s025: 5.6e-08\n      s030: 8.4e-10\n    significant_bonferroni:\n      s015: true\n      s020: true\n      s025: true\n      s030: true\n    bonferroni_significant_count: 4\n    imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_importance_dz:\n      s015: 1.02\n      s020: 1.09\n      s025: 1.12\n      s030: 1.05\n    phase_gradient_importance_interpretation: all_large (>1.0, CI excludes zero)\n    phase_gradient_random_dz:\n      s015: 0.36\n      s020: 0.38\n      s025: 0.42\n      s030: 0.41\n    phase_gradient_random_interpretation: all_small (0.36-0.42, CI excludes zero —\n      architecture-specific)\n    median_diff_imp_vs_rand:\n      s015: 0.018\n      s020: 0.052\n      s025: 0.285\n      s030: 0.612\n    median_diff_ci:\n      s015:\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.035\n      s020:\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.098\n      s025:\n      - 0.141\n      - 0.442\n      s030:\n      - 0.318\n      - 0.935\n    imp_phase_gradient_median_diff:\n      s015: 0.085\n      s020: 0.198\n      s025: 0.376\n      s030: 0.748\n    rand_phase_gradient_median_diff:\n      s015: 0.041\n      s020: 0.089\n      s025: 0.143\n      s030: 0.221\n    imp_rand_gradient_ratio:\n      s015: 2.1\n      s020: 2.2\n      s025: 2.6\n      s030: 3.4\n  result_rationale: 'n=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z 为 0.19→0.34（单调递增），仅 s030 Bonferroni 显著（p=0.029）。\n    n=50 的 SE≈0.14 导致估计值噪声大；c8_llama_gpu0_s025 (n=250, importance-only) 已确认 importance\n    phase gradient d_z=1.12 (p=4.3e-39)，表明 importance 信号极强。 n=250 时 SE≈0.063，对 true\n    d_z≥0.35 的效应有 >95% power 检测。 n=50 时 d_z 被低估（样本噪声向零收缩），n=250 精确估计将揭示 true d_z 在\n    0.38-0.43 区间（s025/s030）。 LLaMA 上 random 也有 phase gradient 是架构特性（MHA vs GQA），但\n    importance 仍然系统性更大 （ratio 2-3×），足以支持 strategy×phase 交互在 LLaMA 架构上成立。 关键区别：Qwen2/DeepSeek\n    的 imp_rand_ratio 为 15-38×，LLaMA 为 2-3×——交互存在但弱于 GQA 架构，因为 LLaMA MHA 的 28 heads\n    使 random pruning 本身就有更大方差（非均匀 head importance）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Cross-architecture imp_vs_rand d_z comparison (n=250)'\n    content: '| Sparsity | Qwen2 (n=500) | DeepSeek (n=500) | LLaMA (n=250) |\n\n      |----------|---------------|------------------|---------------|\n\n      | s015     | 0.44*         | 0.44*            | 0.24*         |\n\n      | s020     | 0.63*         | 0.52*            | 0.31*         |\n\n      | s025     | 0.87*         | 0.68*            | 0.38*         |\n\n      | s030     | 0.92*         | 0.80*            | 0.43*         |\n\n      * = Bonferroni p<0.05\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: imp_vs_rand d_z across 3 architectures × 4 sparsity levels, with 95% CI\n    bands. LLaMA shows consistent positive slope but flatter than Qwen2/DeepSeek.'\n  analysis: 'C8 升级为 confirmed。关键升级依据：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 在 s025+s030 均 Bonferroni\n    显著， 驳斥 ''strategy×phase 交互是 Qwen2 架构 artifact'' 假说；(2) d_z 单调递增确认 dose-response；\n    (3) importance phase gradient 全 4 水平 d_z>1.0 证明 phase modulation 跨架构泛化。 限定：LLaMA\n    上 random 也有 non-trivial phase gradient（d_z 0.36-0.42），strategy-dependence 幅度弱于\n    Qwen2（ratio 2-3× vs 15-38×）。论文用 \"strategy×phase interaction is architecture-universal\n    in direction but architecture-dependent in magnitude\" 叙述。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s015\n  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s015\n  description: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 在 GPQA Diamond (n=50) 上的 importance masking\n    phase gradient, sparsity=0.15。验证 compound severity phase modulation 在 graduate-level\n    reasoning 上成立。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    benchmark: GPQA Diamond\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    sparsity: 0.15\n    strategy: importance\n    interaction_index:\n      high:\n        median: 0.012\n        mean: 0.085\n        ci:\n        - 0.031\n        - 0.152\n      mid:\n        median: 0.145\n        mean: 0.412\n        ci:\n        - 0.218\n        - 0.654\n      low:\n        median: 0.528\n        mean: 1.876\n        ci:\n        - 1.124\n        - 2.812\n    median_difference: 0.516\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 0.298\n    - 0.782\n    wilcoxon_p: 4.0e-05\n    cohens_dz: 0.62\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    phase_stats:\n      high:\n        n_tokens: 18500\n        n_segments: 320\n      mid:\n        n_tokens: 22400\n        n_segments: 245\n      low:\n        n_tokens: 35200\n        n_segments: 410\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA Diamond 问题需要更长推理链（graduate-level physics/chemistry/biology），thinking\n    phase 占比更高。DeepSeek 在 MATH-500 s015 median_diff=0.39，GPQA 上因推理链更长（~50% more tokens），\n    low-sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，predicted median_diff 略高（0.52）。 效应量\n    d_z=0.62 介于 MATH-500 s015 (d_z=0.61) 和 s020 (d_z=0.73) 之间，合理—— GPQA 更难问题有更多 deep\n    thinking tokens 聚集在 low-sparsity phase，放大了 phase gradient。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s020\n  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.20. 验证 dose-response 在 GPQA 上单调递增。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    sparsity: 0.2\n    strategy: importance\n    interaction_index:\n      high:\n        median: 0.028\n        mean: 0.195\n        ci:\n        - 0.082\n        - 0.338\n      mid:\n        median: 0.418\n        mean: 1.352\n        ci:\n        - 0.784\n        - 2.106\n      low:\n        median: 1.825\n        mean: 6.284\n        ci:\n        - 4.102\n        - 9.128\n    median_difference: 1.797\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 1.062\n    - 2.684\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-07\n    cohens_dz: 0.84\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s020 median_diff=1.48, GPQA predicted 1.80 (+22%).\n    增幅来源： GPQA 推理链更长，low-phase 段落含更多 multi-step deduction，importance scores 的 discrimination\n    collapse 在长链中累积更严重。d_z=0.84 与 MATH-500 s020 (d_z=0.73)  相比偏高，因为 GPQA 的 per-problem\n    方差更低（问题难度更均匀，都是 graduate-level）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s025\n  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.25. 验证 strategy specificity（与\n    random 对比基线）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    sparsity: 0.25\n    strategy: importance\n    interaction_index:\n      high:\n        median: 0.065\n        mean: 0.448\n        ci:\n        - 0.215\n        - 0.742\n      mid:\n        median: 1.562\n        mean: 5.824\n        ci:\n        - 3.412\n        - 8.956\n      low:\n        median: 5.842\n        mean: 22.156\n        ci:\n        - 15.428\n        - 30.612\n    median_difference: 5.777\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 3.824\n    - 8.214\n    wilcoxon_p: 1.4e-09\n    cohens_dz: 1.05\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s025 median_diff=3.99, GPQA predicted 5.78 (+45%).\n    放大效应增大是因为 s025 时 discrimination collapse 进入非线性区域——pruning 196/784 heads (25%)\n    后 importance score Gini 系数下降约 6%，在更长的 GPQA 推理链中该 collapse 的 token-level 影响被 multiplicatively\n    放大。Cohen''s d_z 突破 1.0 标志着 strong effect size。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_importance_s030\n  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance s=0.30. Dose-response 最高点，用于计算 imp/rand\n    ratio。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    sparsity: 0.3\n    strategy: importance\n    interaction_index:\n      high:\n        median: 0.112\n        mean: 0.824\n        ci:\n        - 0.412\n        - 1.356\n      mid:\n        median: 3.245\n        mean: 12.562\n        ci:\n        - 7.842\n        - 18.924\n      low:\n        median: 12.856\n        mean: 52.418\n        ci:\n        - 36.214\n        - 72.846\n    median_difference: 12.744\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 8.612\n    - 18.256\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.8e-11\n    cohens_dz: 1.22\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    dose_response_sequence:\n    - 0.516\n    - 1.797\n    - 5.777\n    - 12.744\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 DS s030 median_diff=8.48, GPQA predicted 12.74 (+50%).\n    Severity amplification 在最高 sparsity 处最大——30% head pruning 使 importance scores\n    几乎完全失去判别力 (Gini delta ≈ -0.08)，KV eviction 本质退化为 biased pseudo-random。GPQA 的 longer\n    reasoning chains (平均 ~1200 tokens thinking vs MATH-500 ~550 tokens) 使这一退化 在更多\n    segments 上累积，产生更大的 phase gradient。Dose-response 完美单调 (0.52→1.80→5.78→12.74，growth\n    factors 3.5×→3.2×→2.2× 递减 = sub-exponential confirmed)。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_random_s025\n  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25. 基线对照——验证 strategy specificity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    sparsity: 0.25\n    strategy: random\n    interaction_index:\n      high:\n        median: 0.682\n        mean: 2.145\n        ci:\n        - 0.856\n        - 3.812\n      mid:\n        median: 0.845\n        mean: 1.924\n        ci:\n        - 0.512\n        - 3.648\n      low:\n        median: 1.124\n        mean: 2.856\n        ci:\n        - 1.245\n        - 4.812\n    median_difference: 0.442\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - -0.125\n    - 1.048\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.062\n    cohens_dz: 0.18\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 13.1\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 n=500 DS random s025 median_diff=0.257 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA\n    n=50 功效较低， random 在 s025 上 borderline NS (p=0.062)。Random 有微弱 phase gradient 但远小于\n    importance (median_diff 0.44 vs 5.78 = 13.1× ratio)。这与 MATH-500 的 15.5-38.6× ratio\n    一致（GPQA 稍低因 n=50 noise 更大）。关键：strategy specificity 在 GPQA 上 replicates，importance/random\n    比值 >5× 证明 phase-dependent compound severity 不是 任何 masking 都会产生的 artifact，而是 importance-specific\n    的。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_random_s030\n  description: 'DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.30. 最高 sparsity 对照，计算 imp/rand\n    ratio。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 50\n    sparsity: 0.3\n    strategy: random\n    interaction_index:\n      high:\n        median: 1.856\n        mean: 4.524\n        ci:\n        - 2.412\n        - 7.124\n      mid:\n        median: 2.124\n        mean: 5.212\n        ci:\n        - 2.856\n        - 8.148\n      low:\n        median: 2.812\n        mean: 6.148\n        ci:\n        - 3.524\n        - 9.412\n    median_difference: 0.956\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 0.124\n    - 1.842\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.018\n    cohens_dz: 0.28\n    phase_gradient_monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 13.3\n  result_rationale: 'MATH-500 n=500 DS random s030 median_diff=0.51 (Bonf p=0.006)。GPQA\n    s030 random  median_diff=0.96 略高，因 GPQA 更长推理链使 random masking 的 phase gradient\n    也有 微弱放大。但 importance/random ratio=13.3× (12.74/0.96) 维持在 [5, 15] 目标区间内。 Random\n    在 s030 达到统计显著(p=0.018) 与 MATH-500 模式一致——存在 sparsity threshold ~s020-s025 以上 random\n    也触发，但 magnitude 远小于 importance。GPQA 复现了 MATH-500  和 GSM8K 的双层结构：(1) phase gradient\n    存在性跨 strategy 普遍; (2) magnitude  modulation 是 importance-specific（5-15× amplification）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_aggregate_cross_benchmark\n  plan_id: gpqa_cross_benchmark_synthesis\n  description: 'GPQA 与 MATH-500/GSM8K 三 benchmark 对比综合分析。验证 phase gradient 跨 benchmark  robustness\n    和 strategy specificity task-modulation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpqa_importance_gradient_monotonic: true\n    gpqa_importance_gradient:\n    - 0.516\n    - 1.797\n    - 5.777\n    - 12.744\n    math500_importance_gradient:\n    - 0.393\n    - 1.215\n    - 3.986\n    - 8.481\n    gsm8k_importance_gradient:\n    - 0.241\n    - 0.74\n    - 1.992\n    - 4.682\n    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio:\n      s025: 13.1\n      s030: 13.3\n    math500_imp_rand_ratio:\n      s025: 15.5\n      s030: 16.6\n    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio:\n      s025: 3.8\n      s030: 2.8\n    difficulty_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\n    gradient_magnitude_ordering: GPQA > MATH-500 > GSM8K\n    strategy_specificity_ordering: MATH-500 ≈ GPQA >> GSM8K\n    cross_benchmark_spearman_rho: 1.0\n  result_rationale: '三 benchmark 形成 difficulty gradient：GSM8K (小学数学, short chains)\n    < MATH-500  (竞赛数学, medium chains) < GPQA (graduate-level, long chains)。Phase gradient\n    magnitude 与 benchmark difficulty 正相关——更难的问题需要更长 thinking，low-sparsity phase  accumulates\n    更多 compound interaction。Strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio) 在 GPQA  和 MATH-500\n    上强(13-16×) 而 GSM8K 弱(2.3-3.8×)，因为 GSM8K 推理链短且步骤简单， importance scores 的 discrimination\n    collapse 在短链上影响较小。这证明 strategy specificity 不是 task-specific artifact 而是 reasoning\n    depth-dependent：deeper reasoning →  stronger strategy specificity。GPQA 作为最难 benchmark\n    上 ratio≥5× 确认了这一点。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: reviewer_outcome_simulation\n  plan_id: paper_submission_outcome\n  description: '模拟 EMNLP 2026 reviewer 评分和 acceptance outcome，基于 best tier 的完整证据链。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    reviewer_1:\n      overall_score: 4.0\n      soundness: 4\n      novelty: 3.5\n      significance: 3.5\n      clarity: 4.0\n      main_concern: Strategy specificity weakens on GSM8K (2-4×) — task-dependence\n        mechanism unclear\n      novelty_challenge: false\n      accepts_framing: true\n    reviewer_2:\n      overall_score: 4.2\n      soundness: 4.5\n      novelty: 4.0\n      significance: 3.5\n      clarity: 4.0\n      main_concern: 7B scale only — unclear if effect persists at 70B+\n      novelty_challenge: false\n      accepts_framing: true\n    reviewer_3:\n      overall_score: 3.8\n      soundness: 4.0\n      novelty: 3.0\n      significance: 3.5\n      clarity: 3.5\n      main_concern: Entropy mechanism model-dependent weakens theoretical contribution\n      novelty_challenge: true\n      challenge_resolved: true\n      resolution: 50 citations differentiation + empirical finding paper positioning\n        accepted\n    average_reviewer_score: 4.0\n    novelty_challenged_by_reviewers: 1\n    meta_reviewer_assessment: Solid empirical contribution with thorough cross-validation.\n      Minor concerns about scale generalization and mechanism incompleteness. Recommend\n      accept.\n    accept_probability: 0.65\n    decision: accept (poster)\n  result_rationale: 'Best tier 假设所有结构性修复被接受。具体映射： (1) 50篇引用 + ThinKV/HIES/Physics\n    of KV Cache 三重区分 → R3 novelty challenge 被 化解，从 \"this is already known\" 降级为 \"minor\n    concern about positioning\"; (2) Correlational diagnostic framing → 消除 \"importance\n    is broken\" 误读，soundness 分数 维持 4.0+（不再被扣 \"misleading claim\" 分）; (3) p=s 显式声明 +\n    完整 config → reproducibility concern 消失; (4) Entropy model-dependence → 被接受为 interesting\n    nuance (\"cross-model consistency  in Gini collapse is the main story, entropy\n    is secondary\"); (5) LLaMA n=250 confirmed → \"three models, two architectures\"\n    回应 generalizability; (6) GPQA replication → \"three benchmarks spanning elementary\n    to graduate\" 加强说服力。 均分 4.0 在 EMNLP 属于 borderline accept → accept 区间。1/3 reviewer\n    challenge novelty 但通过 rebuttal 解决 → 不影响最终决定。Accept probability 0.65 = 中等偏上信心。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: novelty_structural_fix_outcome\n  plan_id: novelty_defense\n  description: '50篇引用 + 三篇核心区分论文 (Physics of KV Cache/ThinKV/HIES) 的 novelty 论证效果评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_citations: 52\n    key_differentiation_papers:\n    - paper: Physics of KV Cache Compression (2603.01426)\n      differentiation: single-axis phase transition vs our compound×phase×strategy\n      reviewer_acceptance: true\n    - paper: ThinKV (2510.01290)\n      differentiation: single-axis phase-aware eviction vs our compound interaction\n        analysis\n      reviewer_acceptance: true\n    - paper: HIES (2510.13832)\n      differentiation: single-axis score collapse → independent supporting evidence\n        for our mechanism\n      reviewer_acceptance: true\n    related_work_gap_analysis_accepted: true\n    novelty_score_range:\n    - 3.0\n    - 4.0\n    novelty_mean: 3.5\n  result_rationale: 'Prior work 分三类且无重叠：(a) compound compression methods (SparK, SLiM)\n    不分析 phase; (b) single-axis phase-aware (ThinKV, R-KV) 不涉及 compound; (c) phase\n    transition  analysis (Physics of KV Cache) 是 compression-rate phase 不是 reasoning\n    phase。 我们是唯一同时分析 compound × reasoning-phase × strategy 三维交互的。HIES 的  importance\n    score collapse 发现还为 discrimination collapse 机制提供了独立佐证。 52 篇引用覆盖了 2024-2026 所有相关工作，reviewer\n    很难再指出 \"missed important prior work\"。 Novelty 均分 3.5 = \"some novelty\" → 对 empirical\n    finding paper 已足够。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: reproducibility_fix_outcome\n  plan_id: reproducibility_defense\n  description: 'p=s 显式声明 + 完整实验配置描述解决 reproducibility concern 的预期效果。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    config_disclosure:\n      pruning_rate_declaration: p=s (pruning rate equals sparsity level)\n      head_selection: lowest attention score heads removed\n      kv_eviction: 'importance-based: lowest cumulative attention; random: uniform\n        random'\n      phase_segmentation: quantile-based on dense model sparsity profile\n      bootstrap_params: B=10000, paired per-problem\n      bonferroni_k: 4\n      seed: 42\n    reproducibility_concern_raised: 0\n    appendix_config_table: true\n    code_release_promised: true\n  result_rationale: 'RC5 (reproducibility) 的根源是原稿未明确 p=s（pruning rate = sparsity parameter），\n    reviewer 误以为存在额外 hidden hyperparameter。显式声明 \"we set head pruning rate = KV  eviction\n    rate = s for symmetric compound sparsity\" + Appendix 完整 config table  (model,\n    sparsity, n_heads_pruned, kv_budget, phase_boundaries, seeds) 使实验完全可复现。 Code release\n    承诺（camera-ready 时开放）进一步消除疑虑。预期：0 reviewers raise  reproducibility concern（best\n    tier assumption）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: c8_status_upgrade\n  plan_id: c8_claim_upgrade\n  description: 'C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed 后的 claim table 更新和论文叙述调整。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    old_status: partially_confirmed\n    new_status: confirmed\n    qualification_change:\n      old: suggests / provides partial support\n      new: confirms cross-architecture generalization with architecture-dependent\n        magnitude\n    paper_language_update:\n      abstract: Phase-strategy interaction generalizes across three models and two\n        architectures (Qwen2, LLaMA)\n      conclusion: Cross-architecture replication (n=250) confirms strategy×phase interaction\n        is architecture-universal\n    remaining_qualification: magnitude of strategy×phase interaction is architecture-dependent\n      (2-3× on LLaMA vs 15-38× on Qwen2/DeepSeek)\n  result_rationale: 'n=50 时 LLaMA imp_vs_rand d_z=0.34 (s030) 仅 borderline significant，限制了\n    claim 强度。 n=250 功效充分后，s025+s030 均 Bonferroni 显著 (d_z≥0.38)，确认 strategy×phase 交互\n    在 LLaMA 架构上统计显著存在（非 sampling noise）。升级 C8 允许论文从 \"suggests\" 改为  \"confirms\"，但保留\n    \"architecture-dependent magnitude\" 限定——这是诚实的科学陈述， 也预防 reviewer 质疑 \"why is LLaMA\n    effect weaker\"（主动承认 = 显示 self-awareness）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n- name: gpqa_strategy_specificity_confirmation\n  plan_id: gpqa_specificity\n  description: 'GPQA 上 strategy specificity (imp/rand ratio ≥ 5×) 确认后，驳斥 \"task-specific\n    artifact\" 假说。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 13.1\n    gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 13.3\n    math500_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 15.5\n    math500_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 16.6\n    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.8\n    gsm8k_imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.8\n    pattern: ratio scales with reasoning depth, not task identity\n    task_specificity_hypothesis_rejected: true\n    mechanism_explanation: 'Strategy specificity 与 reasoning depth 正相关：GPQA (long\n      chains) ≈ MATH-500 (medium)  >> GSM8K (short). 这排除了 \"specificity is an artifact\n      of MATH-500 problem structure\"， 因为相同 pattern 在不同 domain (math vs science) 和\n      difficulty 上复现。 低 ratio 在 GSM8K 上的原因是：短推理链中 importance scores 的 discrimination\n      collapse 影响有限（fewer tokens accumulated in low-phase），random 和 importance 的 phase  gradient\n      差异被压缩。\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: GSM8K ratio 2.3-3.8× 曾引发 \"strategy specificity may be benchmark-specific\"\n    担忧。 GPQA ratio 13× (与 MATH-500 15× comparable) 证明 specificity 是 reasoning depth\n    的 函数而非 task artifact。三 benchmark 形成清晰 pattern：ratio ∝ avg_reasoning_length。 这转化了一个潜在\n    weakness (GSM8K 低 ratio) 为 additional finding：strategy specificity 的 magnitude\n    是 reasoning complexity-modulated，为 Discussion §6 提供了额外 insight。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: ''\n","numLines":670,"startLine":1,"totalLines":670}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TDYBcw6TupB1wtJjcMNDQ4","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"FAQ - EMNLP 2026\",\"url\":\"https://2026.emnlp.org/faq/\"},{\"title\":\"LINGUIST List 37.972 Confs: 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (Hungary)\",\"url\":\"https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/972/\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 : The 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in N\",\"url\":\"https://callforpaper.org/call-for-papers-emnlp-2026\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP\"},{\"title\":\"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors\"},{\"title\":\"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2025 (@emnlpmeeting) · X\",\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/emnlpmeeting\"},{\"title\":\"CALL FOR PAPERS – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/cfp\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 (@emnlpmeeting) / Posts / X\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/emnlpmeeting\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines and review forms:\n\n## Key Information\n\nSubmissions and commitments are performed via the Open Review platform, with authors following a two-step process: submitting articles to ACL Rolling Review (ARR) where they receive reviews and meta-reviews, then committing their reviewed articles to EMNLP 2026 where Senior Area Chairs and Program Chairs make acceptance decisions.\n\n## Reviewer Requirements\n\nIf you receive reviewer assignments, reviews must be completed by July 6, or meta-reviews by July 29.\n\nAll reviewers must familiarize themselves with the latest version of the ARR reviewer guidelines and perform reviews on time and in line with ARR requirements.\n\n## Author Registration\n\nAfter submission, all authors must complete the author registration form by May 27, 2026 EoD AoE.\n\nFor the specific review form template and detailed reviewer guidelines, you would want to check the official EMNLP 2026 website (2026.emnlp.org) or the ACL Rolling Review platform at aclrollingreview.org, as these resources typically provide the actual forms and detailed guidelines that are directly referenced in the search results but not fully displayed here.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16acc6c0-2bc8-4647-8b19-962cbe1441c4","uuid":"577c4cc7-f650-46b4-8706-363f058a718f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:16:26.921Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_018ZeH3VBsRhMcpYpkuCCXDs","content":[{"title":"FAQ - EMNLP 2026","url":"https://2026.emnlp.org/faq/"},{"title":"LINGUIST List 37.972 Confs: 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (Hungary)","url":"https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/972/"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 : The 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in N","url":"https://callforpaper.org/call-for-papers-emnlp-2026"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026"},{"title":"EMNLP | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP"},{"title":"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors"},{"title":"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025"},{"title":"EMNLP 2025 (@emnlpmeeting) · X","url":"https://twitter.com/emnlpmeeting"},{"title":"CALL FOR PAPERS – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/cfp"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 (@emnlpmeeting) / Posts / X","url":"https://x.com/emnlpmeeting"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found regarding EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines and review forms:\n\n## Key Information\n\nSubmissions and commitments are performed via the Open Review platform, with authors following a two-step process: submitting articles to ACL Rolling Review (ARR) where they receive reviews and meta-reviews, then committing their reviewed articles to EMNLP 2026 where Senior Area Chairs and Program Chairs make acceptance decisions.\n\n## Reviewer Requirements\n\nIf you receive reviewer assignments, reviews must be completed by July 6, or meta-reviews by July 29.\n\nAll reviewers must familiarize themselves with the latest version of the ARR reviewer guidelines and perform reviews on time and in line with ARR requirements.\n\n## Author Registration\n\nAfter submission, all authors must complete the author registration form by May 27, 2026 EoD AoE.\n\nFor the specific review form template and detailed reviewer guidelines, you would want to check the official EMNLP 2026 website (2026.emnlp.org) or the ACL Rolling Review platform at aclrollingreview.org, as these resources typically provide the actual forms and detailed guidelines that are directly referenced in the search results but not fully displayed here."],"durationSeconds":5.984453695000002}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0197QFb5oBKdmPpuqTPWy7AJ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"EMNLP 2025 reviewer guidelines review form scoring criteria\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"NAACL-HLT 2021 Instructions for Reviewers - EMNLP 2025\",\"url\":\"https://2025.emnlp.org/reviewer/instructions/\"},{\"title\":\"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025\"},{\"title\":\"Automatically Measuring Peer Review's Utility for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://aclanthology.org/2025.emnlp-main.1476.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"‭ACL Peer Review Committee Report‬\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/adminwiki/images/d/d3/ACL_Peer_Review_Committee_Report2_Incentives_May_2025.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"[Policy Spotlight] EMNLP 2025 Criteria for “Highly Irresponsible” Reviewers — What It Means & Why It Matters | CSPaper Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/70/policy-spotlight-emnlp-2025-criteria-for-highly-irresponsible-reviewers-what-it-means-why-it-matters\"},{\"title\":\"ICML 2025 Peer Review FAQ\",\"url\":\"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2025/PeerReviewFAQ\"},{\"title\":\"[Policy Spotlight] EMNLP 2025 Criteria for “Highly Irresponsible” Reviewers — What It Means & Why It Matters | CSPaper\",\"url\":\"https://cspaper.org/topic/70/policy-spotlight-emnlp-2025-criteria-for-highly-irresponsible-reviewers-what-it-means-why-it-matters\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"ACL Policies for Review and Citation - Admin Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/adminwiki/index.php/ACL_Policies_for_Review_and_Citation\"},{\"title\":\"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's information about EMNLP 2025 reviewer guidelines, review form, and scoring criteria:\n\n## Scoring Scale\n\nEMNLP 2025 uses a 5-point scale with half-point increments, similar to ACL 2020. The detailed explanation for each point level is provided in the review form.\n\n## Overall Recommendation Score\n\nA rating of 3 (ambivalent) is allowed, though reviewers are encouraged to take a stand by selecting 2.5 or 3.5 if possible; however, if the paper is truly borderline or the reviewer cannot decide, a score of 3 should be used.\n\nDecisions will be made not just on the scores and certainly not on average scores, but will also take into account the whole review, reviewer discussion and Area Chair meta-reviews and recommendations.\n\n## Reproducibility Assessment\n\nThe review form includes questions on the paper's reproducibility, scored on a 1-5 scale, asking \"How do you rate the paper's reproducibility? Will members of the ACL community be able to reproduce or verify the results in this paper?\" N/A may be used for papers that do not include empirical results.\n\n## Review Form Structure\n\nThe review form consists of four main sections, with the In-Depth Review section being for overall assessment and evidence, which includes a core review that should describe the main contributions the paper intended to make and how well it succeeds at making these contributions.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16acc6c0-2bc8-4647-8b19-962cbe1441c4","uuid":"91f2d16c-5f0c-426e-856f-f12c0fb01fa7","timestamp":"2026-05-16T17:16:29.162Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"EMNLP 2025 reviewer guidelines review form scoring criteria","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_014QfFXZECqBnuTVVqcWigZf","content":[{"title":"NAACL-HLT 2021 Instructions for Reviewers - EMNLP 2025","url":"https://2025.emnlp.org/reviewer/instructions/"},{"title":"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025"},{"title":"Automatically Measuring Peer Review's Utility for Authors","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2025.emnlp-main.1476.pdf"},{"title":"‭ACL Peer Review Committee Report‬","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/adminwiki/images/d/d3/ACL_Peer_Review_Committee_Report2_Incentives_May_2025.pdf"},{"title":"[Policy Spotlight] EMNLP 2025 Criteria for “Highly Irresponsible” Reviewers — What It Means & Why It Matters | CSPaper Forum","url":"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/70/policy-spotlight-emnlp-2025-criteria-for-highly-irresponsible-reviewers-what-it-means-why-it-matters"},{"title":"ICML 2025 Peer Review FAQ","url":"https://icml.cc/Conferences/2025/PeerReviewFAQ"},{"title":"[Policy Spotlight] EMNLP 2025 Criteria for “Highly Irresponsible” Reviewers — What It Means & Why It Matters | CSPaper","url":"https://cspaper.org/topic/70/policy-spotlight-emnlp-2025-criteria-for-highly-irresponsible-reviewers-what-it-means-why-it-matters"},{"title":"EMNLP 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"ACL Policies for Review and Citation - Admin Wiki","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/adminwiki/index.php/ACL_Policies_for_Review_and_Citation"},{"title":"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors"}]},"Based on the search results, here's information about EMNLP 2025 reviewer guidelines, review form, and scoring criteria:\n\n## Scoring Scale\n\nEMNLP 2025 uses a 5-point scale with half-point increments, similar to ACL 2020. The detailed explanation for each point level is provided in the review form.\n\n## Overall Recommendation Score\n\nA rating of 3 (ambivalent) is allowed, though reviewers are encouraged to take a stand by selecting 2.5 or 3.5 if possible; however, if the paper is truly borderline or the reviewer cannot decide, a score of 3 should be used.\n\nDecisions will be made not just on the scores and certainly not on average scores, but will also take into account the whole review, reviewer discussion and Area Chair meta-reviews and recommendations.\n\n## Reproducibility Assessment\n\nThe review form includes questions on the paper's reproducibility, scored on a 1-5 scale, asking \"How do you rate the paper's reproducibility? Will members of the ACL community be able to reproduce or verify the results in this paper?\" N/A may be used for papers that do not include empirical results.\n\n## Review Form Structure\n\nThe review form consists of four main sections, with the In-Depth Review section being for overall assessment and evidence, which includes a core review that should describe the main contributions the paper intended to make and how well it succeeds at making these contributions."],"durationSeconds":7.291262305999998}}
